1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,132
We're SARcastic Scientists from Islamabad.

2
00:00:03,172 --> 00:00:06,370
This is SARtale, for Dancing with the SARs.

3
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:10,442
Pakistan's glacial lakes fill and burst in summer, when

4
00:00:10,482 --> 00:00:13,310
cloud hides them from optical satellites.

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:18,074
NISAR radar, from NASA and ISRO, sees through cloud.

6
00:00:18,114 --> 00:00:21,650
SARtale gives each lake one plain status.

7
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:25,718
Thirty-nine lakes, refreshed every week, so disaster

8
00:00:25,758 --> 00:00:28,730
officers know which lakes to check first.
